              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " gets its flavour from a quick "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "tempering",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "tempering"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " of mustard seeds and curry leaves folded into the mashed potato. The chickpea flour batter should be thick enough to coat the ball without dripping off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fry in small batches. Overcrowding the oil drops the temperature and makes the batter soggy rather than crisp."
          }
        ]
